               Order: score DESC               +
               Limit Hint: 5                   +
         ->  Custom Scan (SiftScan) on rp3 rp_3+
               Index: rp3_body_idx             +
               Query: 'rare'::text             +
               Order: score DESC               +
               Limit Hint: 5                   +
         ->  Custom Scan (SiftScan) on rp4 rp_4+
